  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ceat; tàm incondito garritu &amp; dissolu-</l>
    <l n="2">to furore omni modestiâ posthabitâ</l>
    <l n="3">Sacras Musas interstrepere; calumniis</l>
    <l n="4">tàm impudenter proscindere Inclytæ</l>
    <l n="5">Academiæ Lugduno-Batavæ Profes-</l>
    <l n="6">sorem Medicæ Praxeos Primarium,</l>
    <l n="7">Virum experientissimum, indefessâ</l>
    <l n="8">diligentia de studiosa Juventute opti-</l>
    <l n="9">mè merentem. Ego certè putavi tan-</l>
    <l n="10">tillum me debere honori Facultatis</l>
    <l n="11">Medicæ atque existimationi Colle-</l>
    <l n="12">gæ conjunctissimi, ut hominis auda-</l>
    <l n="13">ciæ obviam irem, demonstraturus je-</l>
    <l n="14">junum hunc Medicum in Philoso-</l>
    <l n="15">phia, Medicina, Hippocrate itidem</l>
    <l n="16">&amp; bonis auctoribus planè hospitem,</l>
    <l n="17">Sylvium non modò nusquam refutas-</l>
    <l n="18">se, sed ne verosimile quidem argu-</l>
    <l n="19">mentum illi objecisse: &amp; quod seriò</l>
    <l n="20">notatum velim, ipsum Sylvio nun-</l>
